​</div><b><i><span style="font-size: 18px">Kanna's father returns to drag her back to the Dragon World as war brews between Chaos and Harmony. Torn between duty and friends, Kanna must decide her path-while a hidden force threatens to consume both worlds.</span></i></b><br>
<br>
<ul>
<li>Directors<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm2128776/?ref_=tt_ov_1_1" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Tatsuya Ishihara</a></li>
