</ul></li>
</ul><div style="text-align: center"><br>
​</div><span style="font-size: 18px"><b>Trivia</b></span><br>
<ul>
<li>This is the first film based on the <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kobayashi-san_Chi_no_Maid_Dragon_(Manga)" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow"><i>Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid</i></a> franchise.</li>
<li>Shiori Sugiura<a href="https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/people.php?id=143644" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">ANN</a> voiced <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Ilulu" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Ilulu</a> in this film, replacing <a href="https://seiyuu.fandom.com/wiki/Mineuchi_Tomomi" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Tomomi Mineuchi</a> following her retirement from voice acting in 2022.<a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kobayashi-san_Chi_no_Maid_Dragon:_Samishigariya_no_Ry%C5%AB#cite_note-7" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">[7]</a></li>
<li>The film marks the first appearance of <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Ilulu" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Ilulu</a>’s true form in its opening credits, albeit in a miniature state, as seen in <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Chapter_140" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Chapter 140</a>. Notably, it features brown horns, as opposed to her standard orange-yellow horns.<a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kobayashi-san_Chi_no_Maid_Dragon:_Samishigariya_no_Ry%C5%AB#cite_note-8" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">[8]</a></li>
<li>Felicitas is portrayed by Japanese enka singer and voice actress <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sachiko_Kobayashi" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Sachiko Kobayashi</a>. Her voice actress was hinted at through an April Fool's marketing stunt featuring Sachiko Kobayashi.<a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kobayashi-san_Chi_no_Maid_Dragon:_Samishigariya_no_Ry%C5%AB#cite_note-9" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">[9]</a></li>
<li>The film's closing theme, "Our Days" was sang by <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Felicitas" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Felicitas</a>' voice actress, Sachiko Kobayashi.<a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kobayashi-san_Chi_no_Maid_Dragon:_Samishigariya_no_Ry%C5%AB#cite_note-10" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">[10]</a></li>
<li>A variant of the closing theme, "Our Days," is sung by <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Naganawa" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Maria Naganawa</a> as <a href="https://maid-dragon.fandom.com/wiki/Kanna_Kamui" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Kanna Kamui</a> on the film's original soundtrack release.</li>
</ul><div style="text-align: center"><br>
​</div>


